'''Le'Solar''' (ハハパオン, ''Haha Paon'', '''Mother Paon''') is a [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] variant of [[Le'boin]] that appears in [[Cats of the Cosmos]], [[The Aku Realms]], and [[Legend Stages]]. She was added in [[Version 6.5 Update|Version 6.5]].

