==Enemy==
The [[:Category:Starred Alien Enemies|Starred Alien]] version of [[Le'boin]], with damage comparable to [[Spacefish Jones]]. She also has one of the strongest [[Barrier]]s in the game, with a breaking point of 40,000.

==Strategy==
Unless you have a [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]], Le'Solar can be a difficult enemy to overcome. You need a strong [[:Category:Anti-Alien Cats|anti-Alien cat]] or a heavy-hitting cat such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] to just destroy her Barrier. Once that's over, you can handle her like a normal [[Le'boin]], as her health isn't particularly high. In some stages, it may be better to forego Bahamut's [[True Form]] in favor of his Normal/Evolved Form, which outranges Le'Solar.

There are several cats that can be used to break Le'Solar's Barrier regardless of the restrictions:

[[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cats]]: Any form of Bahamut Cat works well. However, Crazed Bahamut will require constant meatshielding to make sure Le'Solar doesn't get close enough to hit him, and Awakened Bahamut requires careful timing to ensure that he doesn't waste his attack on an enemy in front of Le'Solar. If you don't wish to expend a Bahamut on Le'Solar, [[Skirt Cat (Special Cat)|Loincloth Cat]] or [[Li'l Gross Cat (Special Cat)|Li'l Macho Legs Cat]] will smash the Barrier in two...with luck.

[[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cats]]: [[Wheel Cat (Rare Cat)|Chill Cat]] (with [[Cat Combo|Combos]]/high levels due to its terrible range), [[Evil Cat (Rare Cat)|Gentleman Bros.]] and [[Space Cat (Rare Cat)|Space Cat]].

[[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cats]]: [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Fencer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Fencer Cat]], [[Cat Toaster (Super Rare Cat)|Catophone]], [[Talents|Talented]] [[Nerd Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cyberpunk Cat]] and [[Little Leaguer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Major Leaguer Cat]].

[[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]]: All sorts. All [[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|ELEMENTAL PIXIES]], most cats with [[:Category:Cats with Strong ability|Strong]]/[[:Category:Cats with Massive Damage ability|Massive Damage]] against Aliens, the few Barrier Breakers and the many Ubers with very high base damage.

