==Trivia==
*The pigtail-like protrusions on her head resemble [[wikia:ultra:Mother of Ultra|Mother of Ultra]]'s Silver Cross Decorations, from the ''[[wikipedia:Ultraman|Ultraman]]'' series. Both characters' Japanese names also contain ''haha'' (meaning "mother"), with Le'Solar being Haha Paon (ハハパオン, "Mother Paon") and Mother of Ultra being Ultra no Haha (ウルトラの母).
**Paon is [[Le'boin]]'s Japanese name, itself derived from the word ''paōn'' (パオーン, the Japanese onomatopoeia for an elephant's cry).
**Paon also means "peacock" in French.
*Despite being female, her name uses "le", a French definite article which is used in masculine nouns.
*Prior to [[Version 15.0 Update|Version 15.0]], there was a typo in her description: instead of saying "invades at least ''three new'' planets a week", it said "invades at least ''new three'' planets a week".
*Her description capitalizes the "b" in "Le'boins".

